1/L2 cache, memory bandwidth (访存带宽), data prefetching (数据预取), double buffering (双缓冲), async copy (异步拷贝), memory coalescing (访存合并), bank conflict avoidance (bank冲突避免), synchronization primitive (同步原语), barrier (栅栏), TLB (Translation Lookaside Buffer), MMU (Memory Management Unit), MoE expert weight prefetch, DiT denoising step memory footprint, multimodal cross-modal memory access, video frame buffer management\n\n---\n\n## Q5.3\n\n**层**: L5\n**问题**: 在 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 的多算子/微算子并发场景下，片上网络（NoC / Mesh / Crossbar / Ring / 树形互联）和片间互联如何设计来支撑计算单元间的高带宽、低延迟通信？有哪些关键的互联架构方法和拓扑选择？\n**预关键词**: Network-on-Chip (NoC, 片上网络), mesh topology (Mesh拓扑), crossbar (交叉开关), ring interconnect (环形互联), tree interconnect (树形互联), on-chip bus (片上总线), AXI (Advanced eXtensible Interface), AHB/APB, high-bandwidth interconnect (高带宽互联), low-latency communication (低延迟通信), flow control (流控), wormhole routing (虫洞路由), virtual channel (虚拟通道), credit-based flow control, router microarchitecture (路由器微架构), bisection bandwidth (对分带宽), collective communication (集合通信), all-reduce, all-to-all (MoE expert), multicast, chiplet interconnect (Chiplet互联), UCIe (Universal Chiplet Interconnect Express), BoW (Bridge of Wires), silicon interposer, advanced packaging (先进封装), die-to-die communication, MoE all-to-all communication, DiT spatial parallelism data exchange, multimodal encoder-decoder cross communication, video pipeline streaming interconnect\n\n---\n\n## Q5.4\n\n**层**: L5\n**问题**: 硬件架构中支持多算子/微算子并发的关键方法（数据流设计、计算单元组织、控制/访存体系、互联架构）在实际硬件平台上的对应实现是什么？涉及哪些框架、工具链和硬件设计流程（RTL / HLS / SystemC / Chisel / Verilog / VHDL）？\n**预关键词**: RTL (Register Transfer Level, 寄存器传输级), HLS (High-Level Synthesis, 高层次综合), SystemC, Chisel (Constructing Hardware In a Scala Embedded Language), Verilog, VHDL, Bluespec, FPGA prototyping (FPGA原型验证), ASIC design flow (ASIC设计流程), EDA tools (电子设计自动化工具), Synopsys Design Compiler, Cadence Genus, Vivado HLS, Catapult HLS, silicon implementation (硅实现), tape-out (流片), place and route (布局布线), clock tree synthesis (时钟树综合), power gating (电源门控), clock gating (时钟门控), DVFS (Dynamic Voltage and Frequency Scaling), GPU architecture implementation (NVIDIA CUDA Core / Tensor Core / SM), NPU architecture implementation (华为达芬奇 / 寒武纪 / Google TPU / Graphcore IPU), accelerator microarchitecture (加速器微架构), systolic array implementation (脉动阵列实现), CGRA implementation (粗粒度可重构阵列实现), dataflow engine implementation (数据流引擎实现), Maxeler / Xilinx AI Engine / Intel Agilex, open-source hardware (开源硬件), RISC-V vector extension, Rocket Chip, Chipyard\n\n---\n\n## Q5.5\n\n**层**: L5\n**问题**: 有哪些硬件架构模拟器、仿真平台或评估工具可以用于评估 MoE、DiT、多模态、Video 负载下多算子/微算子并发的硬件设计？这些工具如何建模计算单元、访存层次、互联和功耗/面积？关键评估指标是什么？\n**预关键词**: gem5 (cycle-level simulator), GPGPU-Sim (GPU simulator), Accel-Sim (GPU微架构模拟器), SST (Structural Simulation Toolkit), SystemC TLM (Transaction-Level Modeling), Verilator (开源Verilog仿真器), Icarus Verilog, Vivado Simulator (XSIM), ModelSim/QuestaSim, McPAT (功耗面积时序建模), CACTI (cache/访存建模), DRAMSim2/DRAMSim3 (DRAM时序仿真), BookSim (NoC仿真器), Garnet (gem5 NoC), Orion (NoC功耗), GPUWattch (GPU功耗建模), Scale-Sim (systolic array模拟器), MAESTRO (DNN accelerator cost model), Timeloop (加速器映射评估), ZigZag (不规则加速器映射), Accelergy (能耗评估框架), FireSim (FPGA加速硬件仿真), performance counter (性能计数器), roofline model (Roofline模型), throughput (吞吐量), latency (延迟), energy efficiency (能效), TOPS/W (每瓦算力), area efficiency (面积效率), bandwidth utilization (带宽利用率), compute utilization (计算利用率), MoE expert load imbalance, DiT diffusion step latency, multimodal encoder-decoder pipeline stall, video frame throughput, power envelope (功耗约束)\n\n---\n\n## Q5.6\n\n**层**: L5\n**问题**: 针对 MoE、DiT、多模态和 Video 负载在单GPU/NPU/加速器上的多算子/微算子并发场景，这些硬件架构方法和实现的实验环境是什么？使用了哪些硬件平台、benchmark 负载和关键性能/能效/面积指标进行评估？\n**预关键词**: NVIDIA GPU (A100 / H100 / B200 实验平台), AMD GPU (MI250X / MI300X), Intel GPU (Ponte Vecchio / Gaudi), Google TPU (v4 / v5), 华为 Ascend NPU (910B), 寒武纪 MLU (370/590), Graphcore IPU (Colossus MK2), Cerebras (Wafer-Scale Engine), Sambanova, FPGA platform (Xilinx Alveo / Versal / Intel Agilex), ASIC test chip (学术流片), MLPerf Inference benchmark, DeepBench (低层级kernel benchmark), Rodinia (异构计算benchmark), PolyBench, Transformer benchmark (BERT/GPT latency/throughput), MoE benchmark (Mixtral 8x7B / DeepSeek-V3 inference), DiT benchmark (Sora-like DiT / Stable Diffusion 3), multimodal benchmark (LLaVA / LLaMA-3-V / GPT-4o 推理), Video benchmark (VideoLMs / VideoPoet), power measurement (nvidia-smi / IPMI / 功率计), die area breakdown (芯片面积分解), PTM (Performance-Thermal-Measurement), 指标: TOPS (Tera Operations Per Second), latency (ms per token / ms per frame), throughput (tokens/s / frames/s), energy per inference (J/token or J/frame), memory bandwidth (GB/s utilization), compute utilization (%), power consumption (W), area (mm²), power density (W/mm²), thermal (junction temperature)\n\n---\n\n## 问题分类\n\n| 分类 | 包含问题 | 说明 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| 方法类 | Q5.1, Q5.2, Q5.3 | 硬件计算模块设计方法（PE阵列/数据流）、控制与访存体系方法、片上网络/互联拓扑方法 —— 覆盖 L5 层三类核心硬件架构方法 |\n| 实现类 | Q5.4 | 硬件架构方法的实际实现 —— RTL/HLS/Chisel 设计流程、FPGA 原型、ASIC 设计、商业硬件平台的具体微架构实现 |\n| 实验环境类 | Q5.5, Q5.6 | 硬件模拟器/仿真器工具链、评估平台、benchmark 和关键指标 —— 覆盖模拟评估方法与实际硬件实验环境 |\n\n## 搜索目录\n\n- `paper_secs/` —— 论文方法章节，查找已发表硬件架构方法\n- `knowledge_notes/` —— 知识笔记，查找微架构概念和技术术语定义\n- `experiment_notes/` —— 实验笔记，查找模拟器配置和 benchmark 结果\n- `idea_notes/` —— 设计思路，查找硬件架构创新与并发设计的思路参考\n\n## 侧重配置\n\n- **侧重标签**: 硬件体系结构\n- **主内容（详述）**: \n  - 硬件计算模块的微架构设计（PE阵列、Tensor Core、NPU MAC阵列的组织方式）\n  - 数据流设计方法（systolic、spatial、dataflow engine）\n  - 控制模块与访存层次对并发的支撑机制\n  - 片上网络拓扑与互联架构\n  - 硬件设计实现流程（RTL/HLS/Chisel → FPGA原型 → ASIC流片）\n  - 硬件模拟器/仿真器的建模方法和精度\n- **辅内容（简略）**:\n  - 软件调度侧与硬件的接口（仅涉及时与硬件协同的部分）\n  - 上层的编译框架/算子融合（主要由 L3/L4 覆盖）\n  - 芯片级封装和多芯片互联（主要由 L6 覆盖，L5 仅在 NoC 层面涉及）\n\n[QUESTION_AGENT_DONE] L5\n","numLines":99,"startLine":1,"totalLines":99}}}
