ed memory 三个子维度评估 SM 可用量）、和 hardware queue（可用的 concurrent strea…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Runlist（GPU运行列表）.md\",\"basename\":\"GPU Runlist（GPU运行列表）\",\"score\":2904.3989960955505,\"foundWords\":[\"concurrent\",\"kernel\",\"gpu\",\"gpux\",\"gpu运行列表\",\"gpu（如\",\"gpu，解析后分发给对应引擎执行。\",\"multi\",\"multi-channel\",\"stream\",\"stream，cuda\",\"streams\",\"execution\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"GPU运行列表\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":70},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":91},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":140},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":163},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":353},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":438},{\"match\":\"GPU，解析后分发给对应引擎执行。\",\"offset\":512},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":607},{\"match\":\"stream\",\"offset\":641},{\"match\":\"GPU（如\",\"offset\":1025},{\"match\":\"gpuX\",\"offset\":1575},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1746},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1773},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1798},{\"match\":\"gpu\",\"offset\":1836},{\"match\":\"gpu\",\"offset\":1883},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":1887},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1938},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":1952},{\"match\":\"concurrent\",\"offset\":2006},{\"match\":\"execution\",\"offset\":2017},{\"match\":\"streams\",\"offset\":2042},{\"match\":\"multi-channel\",\"offset\":2053},{\"match\":\"stream，CUDA\",\"offset\":2163},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2230},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2273},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2317},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2350}],\"excerpt\":\"## GPU Runlist（GPU运行列表）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nGPU Runlist 是 NVIDIA GPU 硬件调度器（Host Interface）中的核心调度数据结构。Runlist 是一个由 GPU 硬件直接管理的 channel 列表，GPU HW scheduler 通过 round-robin 方式在 runlist 内各 TSG（Time-Slice Group）间进行 timeslicing，每个 timeslice 内循环扫描当前活跃 TSG 中所有 channel 的 pushbuffer，寻找有待…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Pack-Forward-Merge Execution Paradigm（打包-转发-合并执行范式）.md\",\"basename\":\"Pack-Forward-Merge Execution Para